    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A wanderer descends into a crystalline labyrinth. Guide them through the maze and help them find the legendary treasure hidden at its core.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PRISM is a 2D exploration game with puzzle elements. Wander through chambers and corridors, get lost in them, then find your way again. Around every level, there are shards hidden behind puzzles and other challenges. Find enough of them, and the way further into the labyrinth will open. As you delve deeper, you will encounter more dangerous obstacles, but you will also find new abilities that will help you overcome them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Non-linear level design focused on exploration</i> - each level is a labyrinth of twisting corridors and branching paths. Scattered along the way are various challenges that will test your brains and your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720570/extras/73d3a481aa2b0e2721c19a7d8008d447.poster.avif?t=1750690461\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720570/extras/73d3a481aa2b0e2721c19a7d8008d447.webm?t=1750690461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720570/extras/73d3a481aa2b0e2721c19a7d8008d447.mp4?t=1750690461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 30 unique levels to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 330 total shards to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 challenging boss fights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720570/extras/b76a532e162b24f8b9fafd7b19bfb521.poster.avif?t=1750690461\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720570/extras/b76a532e162b24f8b9fafd7b19bfb521.webm?t=1750690461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720570/extras/b76a532e162b24f8b9fafd7b19bfb521.mp4?t=1750690461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many secrets hidden along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art, music, story, and everything else in the game made by just one person</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
