oster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720570/extras/b76a532e162b24f8b9fafd7b19bfb521.poster.avif?t=1750690461\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720570/extras/b76a532e162b24f8b9fafd7b19bfb521.webm?t=1750690461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720570/extras/b76a532e162b24f8b9fafd7b19bfb521.mp4?t=1750690461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many secrets hidden along the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art, music, story, and everything else in the game made by just one person</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
